  "input": "What is the availability target for billing-api?\n[2025-03-24] standup/atlas/2025-03-24: The billing API can be released on weekday mornings before 11:00 UTC; anything else needs an exception. [2025-02-06] standup/atlas/2025-02-06: Billing-api calls the ledger service for invoice postings, so treat the ledger service as a hard dependency of billing-api. [2025-11-11] standup/atlas/2025-11-11: Deploy freeze for billing-api: 2025-11-24 to 2025-12-02 (the peak season). Observation from the Atlas team: after Tuesday's deploy, search-indexer's p99 latency doubled.",
